# What the node image installs: the node's dependencies and those of the QRDX EVM fork
# (the py-evm submodule, installed from source with --no-deps). Compiled into
# release/requirements.lock — exact versions, every artifact's sha256 — by
# scripts/release/lock-deps.sh. Edit requirements-v3.txt, then re-lock; never edit the lock.
-r ../requirements-v3.txt
../py-evm
